{
  "description": "Probability lab organism — dice, coin-flip, and general distribution/histogram displays (all a declarative math-canvas plotter driven by config data), an animated random-walk display (converged onto the existing std-prob-walk tick-based integrator), an interactive Bayes' theorem simulator with a population-grid visualization and evidence trials, a Central Limit Theorem sampling engine with a growing means-histogram, a binomial trial accumulator converging to the theoretical PMF, a least-squares regression explorer with live r/R², and a confidence-interval capture display — composed from the std-prob-trials, std-prob-walk, std-prob-bayes, std-prob-clt, std-prob-binomial, std-prob-regression, and std-prob-confidence instrument atoms behind a mode router.",
